Rohan says, "Maya, this is your desk."
I say, "Thank you, Rohan."
I look at the office.
There are fifty desks here.
I look at my desk.
It is very large.
There is a good chair here.
I sit in the chair.
The chair is very comfortable.
I have a large monitor.
But I do not have a pen.
Rohan asks, "Maya, is everything fine?"
I say, "Yes, but I do not have a pen."
Rohan says, "Do not worry, I have another pen."
He gives one pen.
Now I have everything.
I open my laptop.
I start my daily work.
I am very happy here.
